[I] Modern C++20 Unicode library

[T] libunicode is a modern C++20 library that aims to bring painless Unicode
[T] support to C++, with APIs for Unicode character database properties,
[T] UTF-8 and UTF-32 conversion, character width and grapheme and script
[T] segmentation.

[A] Tom Tromey <tromey@cygnus.com>
